 \item {\textbf{DFT $(b=\infty)$}:}  A continuous-phase DFT pattern is used as an optimal-performance benchmark.
 \item {\textbf{CE-Baseline}:} A discrete RIS beam pattern design presented in \cite{you2020channel} based on a quantized DFT and truncated Hadamard method. 
