 {\cos {\varphi _y}\sin {\varphi _z}}&{\sin {\varphi _x}\sin {\varphi _y}\sin {\varphi _z} + \cos {\varphi _x}\cos {\varphi _z}}&{\cos {\varphi _x}\sin {\varphi _y}\sin {\varphi _z} - \sin {\varphi _x}\cos {\varphi _z}}
