with ${{\mathbf{R}}_1} = {{\mathbf{B}^*}}{{\mathbf{H}}_{{\mathrm{BI}}}^*}{{\mathbf{R}}^T_{\mathrm{x}}}{{\mathbf{H}}_{{\mathrm{BI}}}^T}{\mathbf{B}}$.
