Longitudinal recordings from 57 EDU patients with AS enabled assessment of whether disease-associated pulse features changed after valve intervention. These comprised 53 preoperative, 40 postoperative and 13 follow-up assessments, including 38 patients with paired preoperative and postoperative recordings.
