\section*{Data availability}
\noindent The individual-level data from the EDU cohort are not publicly available owing to institutional ethics restrictions and hospital data governance policies. Access to de-identified EDU data may be considered upon reasonable request to the corresponding author, subject to approval by the relevant ethics committee and institution.
The MIMIC-III Clinical Database, MIMIC-III Waveform Database Matched Subset and ECHO-NOTE2NUM used in this study are available through PhysioNet under their respective access policies\cite{MIMIC,MIMICWave,EchoNotes}. Access to the MIMIC-III clinical data and ECHO-NOTE2NUM requires PhysioNet credentialing, completion of the required training and acceptance of the relevant data use agreements. The matched waveform subset is openly available under the Open Data Commons Open Database License v1.0.
