\noindent The core analysis code for PulseAS is publicly available at \url{https://github.com/Joseph-wang-sus/PulseAS}. Net1D used the \href{https://github.com/hsd1503/resnet1d}{resnet1d software implementation by Shenda Hong}. AnyPPG weights are obtained under the upstream license. Model-access and representation-generation instructions are provided in the repository.
