 egin{proposition}[Certified ascent]
\label{prop:ascent}
Let $S_1\ge S_2$ be two MM surrogates of $f$ tight at $ ar{\mathbf x}$, and let $\mathbf x_i^+\in\argmax_{\mathbf x\in\mathcal X}S_i(\mathbf x; ar{\mathbf x})$. Then
