]{fig1a.jpeg}
\caption{
Overview of the generator-guided slice-wise 2D Fourier Domain Adaptation pipeline. For each generator, 40 synthetic 2D TEE images serve as appearance-style donors for 40 selected MVSeg2023 training volumes. FDA modifies selected low-frequency amplitude components while retaining the source-image phase. The original expert segmentation mask is reused unchanged. The 40 FDA-adapted volumes are combined with the 105 original real training volumes to form a 145-volume training set for DeepMitral.
}
\label{fig:pipeline}
