In terms of weighted max-min SINR, the proposed MA algorithms outperform the corresponding FPA schemes under both CSI error models. This superior performance is attributed to the active movement of antenna elements, which enhances the desired user channels and provides additional spatial DoFs to suppress covert signal leakage toward wardens.
